window.products.push({"id":166055,"name":"ChefWave Milkmade Non-Dairy Milk Maker with Kava Espresso Machine (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYCMuHz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the ChefWave Milkmade Non-Dairy Milk Maker and Káva Espresso Machine, you can easily create delicious, plant-based dairy alternative beverages and add them to your coffee and more. ChefWave Milkmade Non-Dairy Milk Maker With 6 preset milk-making programs, digital touch control, easy storage, and an auto-clean function, Milkmade is a reliable part of your daily routine. Easily Make Plant-Based Milk Alternatives Milkmade makes it easy to create gluten-free and vegan non-dairy milk alternatives. Patented technology extracts flavor from the raw ingredients, and then it pulverizes and filters the pulp. In less than 16 minutes at just a click of a button, your milk is ready. Customizable Experience Six plant-based milk programs allow you to make almond milk, soy milk, cashew milk, oat milk, macadamia milk or coconut milk. Enjoy these milk alternatives hot or cold and in one of two batch sizes: 10 fl. oz. or 20 fl. oz. Hassle-Free The included glass pitcher allows easy storage in the refrigerator. Milkmade is self-cleaning thanks to the auto-clean function. ChefWave Kava Mini Espresso Machine The Káva Espresso Machine warms up in just 30 seconds and brews coffee at the touch of a button. This small machine is sleek yet powerful with 20 bar pressure. A compact and modern design doesn’t crowd your counter space. The capsule container conveniently stores used capsules until you throw them away (capsules are not included). Product Features The Chefwave Espresso Machine features a 2-hour auto-off, energy-saving mode, and standby mode. It has a drip container and drip tray and adjustable cup support. The tray fits espresso cups up to 2.7 oz. Two 2.7oz. double-walled cups are provided for your convenience. The water reservoir is dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYCMuHz3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChefWave","source_asin":"B08ZVDMPSJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZVDMPSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZVDMPSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
