window.products.push({"id":166134,"name":"MDOMINIQUE Studded Tumbler with lid and straw | Reusable cup with lid and straw | Water tumbler with straw and lid (24oz, Matte Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710zRHlrN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH & STURDY: Show your passion for fashion with this Studded Cup. Made with heavy-duty material, this color changing tumbler is durable enough for everyday use. This tumbler cup features sturdy studs on the outside, giving it an elegant look while offering a comfortable grip. Stay hydrated in style. Matte tumblers or Iridescent tumblers? Choose the best one that suits your personality. DOUBLE WALLED & SWEAT PROOF: With 9'' height and 24 oz capacity, this BPA Free Iced coffee cup can hold plenty of your favorite cold beverages. Its double wall insulated feature does an excellent job of keeping your drinks cold for hours. Thanks to its sweat proof design, it keeps your hands dry all the time. LEAKPROOF DESIGN & WIDE MOUTH: In fact, this studded water cup is designed with snug fit screw on lid and silicon lid seal which prevents leakage and spills, making it a convenient travel cup. The tumbler's wide mouth opening makes it easy to wash. WIDE APPLICATIONS, CUPHOLDER FRIENDLY & DIY model: These color changing cups with lids and straws are perfect not only for water but also for iced coffee, iced teas, fruit juices, lemonade, smoothies and more. This studded tumbler with straw designed to fit any standard size cupholder has a DIY logo placement reserved for your personalization. REUSABLE, PERFECT COMPANION and GIFTABLE: Best of all, this cute tumbler with straw which is an ideal gift option for any occasions is reusable. Its straw is designed with a stopper so you can use it any way you want – whether with stopper down or stopper up. Take this tumbler anywhere you go – in the office, in school, in the gym, travelling, or just anywhere you go. Make this tumbler your perfect companion for your daily hydration goal. TUMBLER CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Handwash Only. Not Dishwasher Safe. Not Microwave Safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710zRHlrN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MDOMINIQUE","source_asin":"B09W12DZ3M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W12DZ3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W12DZ3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
