window.products.push({"id":166183,"name":"Fancy Paper Towel Holder Stand | Black Stylish Wrought Iron | Decorative Countertop Holder | Handmade Crafted By RTZEN-Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gJ-B0MvBL._AC_SL1348_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your new Handmade Fancy Paper Towel Holder No frustration again. From today you can hold a dinner plate and grab a napkin at the same time.  This paper towel holder stands heavy on your dining table allowing you to tear easily and comfortably paper towel squares.  It fits both standard and large-size paper rolls. Combine functionality and beauty with this Paper Towel Stand At RTZEN-Décor we are dedicated to produce for you high quality, durable and stylish decorative items.  The art of blacksmithing is more relevant and charming now than ever, it is both beautiful and functional in modern 21st century homes and offices.  This iron artistic hand-crafted decorative paper towel holder is suitable for any interior, and will beautifully fit your bathroom, kitchen and office.  Whether you live in the city or in a farmhouse, whether you like modern design or a more rustic style - this decorative paper towel holder will fit beautifully in your home and office.  If you are a chef, own a restaurant or a shop - this paper towel stand will give a special look and atmosphere to your place.  Can be used as an over cabinet paper towel holder or under your counter. Decorative sturdy alternative to wall mount hanging holders.  Fits beautifully to your home decor whether it is white, black, bronze, red or any other color. Long-lasting This strong paper towel holder is made from solid iron with special plating which makes it durable and long-lasting. Easily tear and fold your paper towel tissue. Easy to clean Forget wood items & Vinyl items. You’ll now enjoy cleaning in no-time Handmade Wrought Iron Products Line by RTZEN-Décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gJ-B0MvBL._AC_SL1348_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTZEN","source_asin":"B07BJ6SJDG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BJ6SJDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BJ6SJDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
