window.products.push({"id":166195,"name":"Genie's Poems Poem About Cape Cod, 209, Double-matted In Navy/white And Enhanced With Watercolor Graphics. Finished Size 8x10.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XPtEGUOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful, heart-stirring verse is sure to touch the heart of anyone who has spent time on beautiful Cape Cod. It was created by nationally recognized poet, Genie Graveline. Genie's work can be found in fine gifts shops throughout the country. This quality product is 8x10 in size. It is double-Matted. The Verse is ……….. Cape Cod... The Place I Love!...... I love to walk on the shores of the Cape,…… And let the wind take my hair,…… Barefoot and free, my troubles escape,…… Like the seagulls that fly through the air……. The Cape is a welcome refuge for me,…… From the wildflowers that grow by the road,…… To the quaint little shops that beckon me in......... Just being here...lightens my load!...... Calmed by the waters that rise and fall,…… I’m at peace when I’m here by the sea,…… Where the smell of the ocean is everywhere,…… Cape Cod is like “heaven” to me!......","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XPtEGUOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genie's Poems","source_asin":"B000MOL1C0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000MOL1C0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000MOL1C0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166196,"name":"Elrene Home Fashions Versailles Faux-Silk Room-Darkening Curtain Panel, Blackout Curtain with Rod Pocket, 52 Inches by 84 Inches, Gold, 1 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltW27QsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elrene Home Fashions provides beautifully fashionable home decor to suit any decorating taste. Capture that trendy style with our Versailles Faux-Silk Room-Darkening Curtain Panel for your bedroom, living room, apartment, or office. Easy to hang, this panel has an elegant and sturdy sewn-in 4 inch rod pocket and will fit up to a 2-inch-diameter curtain rod. This single panel comes in a variety of lovely solid colors to fit any home color palette and will add opulent elegance to your windows.Increase the beauty and classic style of any room while also reducing light. With beautiful simplicity, this single panel combines practicality and looks. Room-darkening technology pairs with fashion to present a curtain panel that can block the sun, keep furniture from fading, and help with temperature control. Made from durable 100% polyester, this sliding divider curtain hangs beautifully and has a wonderful silk-like appearance and texture. The heavy-duty curtain is sturdy and will stand up to daily use and sun exposure. It also has enough weight and thickness to provide a lifetime of stylish good looks. Simple care means that a machine wash is all that is needed to keep this long drape looking amazing. It is a worthy investment for your home and is available in 3 sizes: 52\" W x 84\" L; 52\" W x 95\" L; and 52\" W x 108\" L.Established in 1922, Elrene Home Fashions was founded on the principles of quality and guaranteed satisfaction. With the help of our expert artists and designers, we produce high-quality, fashionable home decor for every home and decorating palate. We are 100% committed to our customers and strive to give the very best in all of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltW27QsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elrene Home Fashions","source_asin":"B01MYPHEPM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYPHEPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYPHEPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
