window.products.push({"id":166347,"name":"Creme Brulee Ramekins 4 oz Oven Safe, ALELION Heart Shaped Porcelain Ramekins for Baking, Souffle Dish Small Ramekins for Pudding, Custard Cups, Set o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NvY+Bqf1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portion Size for Multiple Uses: Measured as 3.54 inches in diameter, 1.77 inches in height with 4 oz normal capacity; These ramekins are the perfect size for cooking prep and serving individual portions of desserts, creme brulee, snacks, ice cream, souffle, small onion soup appetizers, puddings, custard, sauces and so much more. These creme brulee ramekins also can be used to make baby food in the pressure cooker. Super Cute Heart Shape Design: These heart shaped ramekins 4 oz oven safe surely add the perfect touch to your tablescape especifically for date nights, wedding day and valentines day. Also, these bright, white, little hearts will add a smile to your meal or snack. Happy every day. Durable and Food Safe: The thick, stackable porcelain ramekins are lead-free and move easily from the oven, to the microwave, and then to the freezer without breaking a sweat. Glazed porcelain is elegant and eco-friendly, unlike plastic. Never worry about harmful toxins leaching into your food. Safe to use in the dishwasher, microwave, oven, air fryer or instant pot. Stackable & Easy to Clean: The texture of the souffle dish is smooth and anti-scratch, easy to clean in hand-washing or dishwasher. The precisely-designed fluted edge makes them securely stackable for convenient storage. No wobble when stacked, limiting breakage and glaze abrasion. Gift for Baking Lovers: These small ramekins are attractive enough and coordinate well with other dinnerware. Also an ideal present of wedding, party, the festival, housewarming and anniversary, which can be given happiness to your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NvY+Bqf1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALELION","source_asin":"B09B28TZ52","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B28TZ52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B28TZ52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
