window.products.push({"id":166479,"name":"Bed Tite Stretch Fit 300-Thread Count 100-Percent Cotton Ultra Luxurious Deep Pocket Sheet Set (Twin, Taupe)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJ4YwGyXL._AC_SL1101_.jpg","description":"The biggest consumer complaint about fitted sheets was that they didn't fit well or stay in place. Research conducted by Cotton Inc.'s Lifestyle Monitor found that 41-percent of consumers had a problem with the bottom bed sheet fitting properly. 90-Percent said they would buy a sheet with stretch properties, while 88-percent said they would pay more for such a product. We've designed a sheet that not only fits perfectly on every mattress but also did it without breaking the bank. Our Patent pending design guarantees the fitted sheet will never shift or slip. In fact, it actually fits better after laundering. These amazing sheets and pillowcases are sewn from fine-woven 300 thread-count 100-percent long staple cotton that has been mercerized. The benefits are that it creates sheets and pillowcases that have a beautiful sheen, higher luster, increased durability and are extremely smooth to the hand. The fitted sheet is the star of this amazing set. The typical fitted sheet only has 1 band of elastic to keep it in place allowing it to shift, bunch and pull up off the corners overnight. The Bed Tite fitted sheet is a one-piece seamless construction and has an incredible 15 parallel lines of high-quality elastic built into the head and foot which allows it to stretch and conform to any mattress from 7-to-20 Inches thick for an amazing fit every time. There is no skirt or inserted material to rip or tear meaning it won't lose tension or come loose from the bed. It is perfect to use on pillow top mattresses, airbeds and mattresses that have an additional mattress topper or pad. This twin size 3-piece sheet set includes an oversized 71-by-96 inch flat sheet for full coverage; one 20-by-32 inch standard size pillowcase and a 39-by-75 inch stretch fit fitted sheet. Both the flat sheet and the pillowcase come with a 4-inch turn back hem treatment for a fully finished look. Machine wash/dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kJ4YwGyXL._AC_SL1101_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bed Tite Stretch Fit","source_asin":"B01IAEIAZE","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IAEIAZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IAEIAZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
