window.products.push({"id":166518,"name":"Smuxee 43 Inch Narrow Console Table with Shelf, Industrial Entryway Table with Stable Metal Bracket, Long Skinny Sofa Table Behind Sofa for Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hRnN8LYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL TABLE】This console tables for entryway is a great choice for your daily use. It fits behind your couch or mezzanine sofa, entryway for family framed photos, greenery, keys, bags, etc. The bottom shelf is sophisticated while providing great storage support. 【SUITABLE SIZE】Sized in 43.3\"L x 11.8\"W x 30.7\"H. This narrow sofa table takes up very little space, yet it has a lot of storage space. The upper tabletop can hold bags, books, snacks, TVs, etc. The lower shelf can hold boxes, shoes, storage boxes, books and vases. 【STABLE AND RELIABLE】Our narrow entryway table is made of high quality particle board and sturdy iron structure, with a double-layer setup that greatly increases storage space, and the long skinny table talso comes with metal fixings that can be used to secure it to wall nails for added stability. 【WIDELY USED】Our foyer tables for entryway is functional and can be used in a variety of scenarios. You can use it as a thin table behind your sofa to conveniently hold your key drop and hat, or as a thin console table to hold your TV, or place it in your entryway as an entry way table. The modern and stylish style can decorate your space perfectly. 【EASY TO INSTALL】Our packages are equipped with an installation manual that will assist you well with the assembly of the table, and couch table behind sofa will only take you a few moments to get a great finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hRnN8LYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smuxee","source_asin":"B0C13R5H15","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C13R5H15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C13R5H15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166519,"name":"Kaps for K-Cups (18 + Brush) - Reuse Your Keurig K-Cups - Over 30,000 Sold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-Nkef6hnL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Also available in quantities of 3 and 9. Check \"Other My-Kap products\" above. This product contains eighteen (18) My-Kap™ kaps, one removal tool, one cleaning brush, and instructions. Colors are CLEAR, RUBY RED, and EMERALD GREEN. You also get a guarantee. If you are not satisfied within 30 days, you can send it back and we will refund your money. If it breaks any time, we will replace it. These kaps will allow you to reuse your Keurig K-Cups many times. You can refill your K-Cups with your favorite coffee or tea. Three colors are included, clear, red, and green. In addition a cleaning brush is included which also can also be used as a removal tool to remove the kap from the K-Cup after it has been used.  The Keurig standard approach involves the purchase of K-Cups with coffee, tea, hot chocolate, etc. The K-Cups make excellent coffee. But they each cost anywhere from $.25 to $.50 per cup depending on the quantity and where you purchase them. If you like to drink coffee like me, this can add up to quite a bill really quickly.   So you say, why not get a reusable K-Cup. Good idea. But there are a few problems with the system Keurig wants you to use. First the reusable K-Cups cost 4 and up. If you want 10 of them, that is 40 just for the reusable cups. Second, the Keurig's resusable K-Cup does not produce as good of a cup of coffee as the K-Cup itself. The designs are different and the water flows out the sides of the filter rather than down through the coffee. Third, the design is big, bulky, and hard to store. If you already have a turnstile for K-Cups, you can not store these there. With this product you can.  The Kap allows you to recycle your K-Cups. Fill them with your favorite coffee or tea. And use them many times before they have to be thrown out for good. That lowers your cost for each cup of brew and also give you better brews each time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-Nkef6hnL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My-Kap","source_asin":"B002TQRM9U","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002TQRM9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002TQRM9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
