window.products.push({"id":166554,"name":"Hypnotic Gems Materials: 2 lbs XXSmall Brazilian Tumbled Polished Natural Stones Assorted Mix - Gemstone Supplies for Wicca, Reiki, and Energy Crystal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QFJwQlffL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Hypnotic Gems brand of natural Brazilian tumbled stones uses only the finest quality high energy rough from specific mines. They are tumbled using a specialized proprietary technique in our own tumbling factory. This technique increases the stones energy and gives the stones from Hypnotic Gems their beauty!Some types of stones you may receive in this mix include: Amethyst, Citrine, Emerald, Clear Quartz, Rose Quartz, Blue Quartz, Smokey Quartz, Green Aventurine, Snow Quartz, Hematite, Amazonite, Red Jasper, Yellow Jasper, Carnelian, Sodalite, Nephrite, Bronzite, Black Onyx, and more!When Hypnotic Gems makes this assortment it is tumbled using more than 1,000 pounds of assorted materials in giant drums. These stones are then poured at random into bags which equal the weight being purchased. Because the mix is made in this way it is possible you will not receive every stone type listed in your mix, and you will likely receive duplicates of some of the stones types.The stones in this listing are our standard grade and we also offer a superior quality natural tumbled stone mix with a larger variety. With the superior mix we hand put each stone into the bag one at a time to guarantee every material type is received. To see our superior quality stones you can search Amazon for \"Hypnotic Superior Tumbled Stones\"Please note that as earth mined stones there may be some imperfections or blemishes that can still show even after being tumbled. Due to natural characteristics some materials tumble smoother than others. Every piece is unique and all pieces received will not be the exact same size, shape, color or look identical as seen in our images. What we do guarantee is that every piece will be spectacular and contain a strong positive energy that can only be found in the Hypnotic Gems brand of tumbled stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QFJwQlffL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B00FY7VAS0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FY7VAS0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FY7VAS0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
