window.products.push({"id":166562,"name":"Detectorcatty Creative Multifunctional Garlic Ginger Crusher Grinder Press Rotate Kitchen Gadget Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WbO5b+4XL._AC_SL1245_.jpg","description":"Description: Brand new and high quality. Easy to assemble and use garlic mincer. Simply pop the garlic into the receptor at the top, rotate the handle and watch as it gets ground out the other end. Easy to clean, dish washer safe. Provide best way to shred garlic. Quality material durable usability. Material:Plastic. Package Includes:","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WbO5b+4XL._AC_SL1245_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Detectorcatty","source_asin":"B082ZVNTWF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082ZVNTWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082ZVNTWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166563,"name":"The Smart Back Coccyx Foam Seat Cushion – Perfect for Back Pain – Includes Best Back Safety Medical Recommendations – Bonus: Free Membership! Smart Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913YacrqfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tell me if this sounds familiar to you You sit down and you feel a typical jolt in your back. Or you squirm in your seat trying to find a comfortable position to relieve that painful coccyx you bruised or broke a few weeks back. Or you have been sitting at your desk working for a while and you start feeling that dulling pain in your low back. You know it will only get worse as the day goes by. It’s one of those too many familiar days. You end up tired and irritable, and the rest of the family will pay the price. Whatever it is, it doesn’t have to be that way and it’s time we do something about it. Prolonged sitting has become the curse of our life and we are suffering from “sitting disease”. The average American sits for 13.5 hours a day! And it’s killing your back and increasing your risk of developing other diseases such as heart attack and obesity. It’s not about a seat cushion, it’s about you! The truth is, there are many other seat cushions you could buy. But it’s never about the cushion. It’s about how you use it. And most people use it improperly. At Smart Back Medical, we don’t want to sell you a cushion. We want to give you a complete experience that will help you ensure the use of a seat cushion is safe for you, show you how to use it properly, and show you what else you can do to alleviate your back pain, improve your spinal wellness and enjoy a better posture. And more importantly, not become a victim of “sitting disease”. That’s why, when you purchase your seat cushion today, we’ll give you access to our exclusive and private Smart Back Academy. If you’re not happy with your experience, we’ll refund your money and you can keep your membership access. You are backed by our pain-free, lifetime satisfaction guarantee. Click the yellow “add to cart” to place your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913YacrqfSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Back Medical (a Swiss Company)","source_asin":"B00KIPKMYG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KIPKMYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KIPKMYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166564,"name":"SignMission Five Somewhere 1 Wall Clock Beer Happy Hour Drink Gift, Beagle, 1five O'clock 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrV2lVA7S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Get a fun Wall Clock for your home and office and show off your sense of style. Looking for a fun, hilarious clock to hang on your cubicle or in your &; man cave? If so, SignMission has all the cute, funny, hilarious, and even work-related novelty clocks you're looking for! Something for Everyone We've got a wide range of American-made clocks just like this one that will tickle your funny bone, make others smile, or even show off your snarky attitude. Product Details: This wall clock measures 10 inches in diameter. It has a black plastic frame with a clear cover. The graphics are rich and vibrant and will last a lifetime. The clock has precision quartz movement and operates on 1 AA battery (not included). These clocks make a great accent to any room in your home or business. A perfect addition to your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, family room or anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrV2lVA7S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SignMission","source_asin":"B003ZZUK7K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ZZUK7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ZZUK7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166565,"name":"Caspari Ostrich Coaster, Orange, Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7183CGkpD2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Entertaining with caspari felt-backed coasters, from our gallery collection. Need something to spice up the dinner table every night or for a special gathering? Our functional and stylish coasters add a punch of color and texture to your table top. Offered here in faux orange ostrich, you can have the opulent look of ostrich without the price tag. All products in our gallery collection are handmade in the united states by experienced bookbinders working in traditional methods of the craft. Clean-up is a snap, just wipe clean with a soapy damp cloth. Each coaster measures 4-inch by 4-inch. Finish the look with our placemats and items from our coordinating high-end paper table top collection. Includes paper plates, napkins and cups, even acrylic stemware and top quality pillar and taper candles. Caspari - bringing beauty, style and convenience into your home every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7183CGkpD2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B0098WDG8Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0098WDG8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0098WDG8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166566,"name":"M-Audio Fast Track Studio US85200 USB Audio Interface with Microphone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JXSXVP22L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description You need more than a standard audio card to record guitar and vocals into your computer--and Fast Track USB is the perfect solution. It includes all the software you need to make music today, and is also an ideal companion for Apple's GarageBand TM, Sony AcidTM, Magix Music MakerTM and other software. Just connect Fast Track USB to the USB port of your computer and you're ready to rock. Fast Track USB has an input for instruments like guitar, bass and keyboard, plus a professional microphone input for recording vocals or acoustic instruments. Fast Track USB employs the same M-Audio technology the pros use to make music. A special edition of the Ableton Live remix/recording software. Amazon.com Whether you're just getting started or you want to take your music to the next level on your PC or Mac, Fast Track Studio is a complete, full-featured solution. The bundle is centered on a professional USB audio interface that helps you record guitar, vocals, and more directly onto your computer. Fast Track Studio also includes GT Player Express software and its virtual guitar effects, along with a dynamic vocal microphone for voice recording. The hardware and software are so easy to set up that you'll be making music almost immediately, plus it's completely compatible with most popular music software, such as Apple's GarageBand, Ableton Live, Sony Acid, Magix Music Maker, and more. The all-in-one solution is based on the same M-Audio technology used by recording professionals in studios around the world. To use the USB interface, merely connect the device to your computer's USB port and you're ready to rock. Fast Track USB has an input for a guitar, bass, keyboard, or other instrument, plus a professional microphone input for recording vocals or acoustic instruments. Meanwhile, the included GT Player Express software gives you killer effects and virtual stomp boxes that sound cool without requiring any additional gear. The software also plays standard audio files such as AAC, MP3, and WAV that let you learn and jam along with your favorite music at variable speeds. You even get a ton of ProSessions drum loops to jam with--it's like having a real drummer on call. Meanwhile, Fast Track Studio's included SoundCheck microphone employs a frequency response tailored to bring out the best in your vocals. It also features a contoured design that feels great in the hand, a convenient on/off switch, and an internal dual-layer pop filter. A professional low-noise microphone cable is also included. What's in the Box USB audio interface, GT Player Express software, SoundCheck microphone, microphone cable, user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JXSXVP22L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M-Audio","source_asin":"B0007D52SK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007D52SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007D52SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166567,"name":"Carolina Creekhouse Lila FloorFlat (042260UA) | Decorative Vinyl Floor Covering | Lay Flat | Durable | No Curling Edges | Waterproof | Easy Clean | Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KGhc7kDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OPENING NIGHT Add drama to your room with the kaleidoscope design in our Lila FloorFlat. Mat features a black and white graphic arrangement of diamonds and triangles. This eye-catching design matches your welcoming personality and home decor-style while at the same time protecting your precious floors. Our 2’ x 3’ mat is the ideal size in front of your kitchen or bathroom sink, outside under the covered front or back patio door, and more. BENEFITS OF FLOOR FLATS Our FloorFlats have been developed by design to lay flat on any hard surface floor (not recommended for carpet). Resting flush with your flooring, our low profile 2mm flats prevent doors from catching on the mat while opening and closing. The no curl edges of the mat lay flat so no need to worry about tripping or falling. DURABLE AND RESISTANT Thin, premium matte vinyl mats protect your floors from spills, scratches, abrasions, and the wear-and-tear of daily use. Spruce up the high traffic spaces in your home without the costly expense of new floors. Our mats are suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor patios. The decorative pattern and dynamic colors provide aesthetic appeal that will continue to please over the years. EASY TO CLEAN Our low maintenance FloorFlats are easy to clean plus stain and fade resistant. These waterproof mats offer trouble-free cleaning in just seconds! No need for harsh chemicals or carpet cleaners, simply wipe with soapy water for a just-like-new finish. Spills, dirt, pet messes – no worries! FloorFlats will quickly become your go-to-solution in many areas of your home. PATRIOTIC AND RESPONSIBLE Our FloorFlats are proudly made in the USA. Your family’s safety is of upmost importance so feel comfortable knowing our materials are are non-toxic and kid/pet friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KGhc7kDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Creekhouse","source_asin":"B08XYFZTXH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XYFZTXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XYFZTXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
