window.products.push({"id":166645,"name":"Loosh Queen Size Sofa Bed Futon Mattress - 11\" USA Made, Teal, Frame Not Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":360.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmtVBCSHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY LOOSH HOME 11\" Queen FUTON MATTRESS: Our modern futon mattress from Loosh is the perfect piece of décor for your bedroom, living room, dorm room, or guest room. Designed with a soft and sleek lightweight cover and finished with hand-tufted detail that gives it a plush, sofa-like look, our mattresses are extremely stylish and comfortable. MADE TO ORDER IN THE USA: Unlike other futons that are made well before you place your order, we make every one of our mattresses after you’ve placed your order which allows you to get the freshest and highest quality product and avoid any wear and tear. MEDIUM FIRM SUPPORT: Crafted with layers of supportive high-density foam enveloped in breathable cotton batting, our Loosh futon mattresses are built evenly across to conform to your body and provide good support and pressure relief in problem areas with medium/firm support. Plus, they’re flippable and foldable for comfort at any angle: sitting, sleeping, or just lounging around on the floor, bed, or couch. SIZES FOR EVERYONE: Maximize any space with extra seating or sleeping with whichever size fits best: Twin (75” x 39”), Full (75” x 54”), or Queen (60” x 80”). Choose between 4 depths of cushion and support: 5”, 7”, 9”, or 11”. Available in a variety of colors that work seamlessly with your room design. PERFORMANCE TESTED: Our CertiPUR-US certified foam mattresses are performance and durability tested. The foam in our mattresses meet quality standards for content, emissions, and longevity after being analyzed by independent and accredited testing laboratories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmtVBCSHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loosh","source_asin":"B0BGSM8XVJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSM8XVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSM8XVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
