window.products.push({"id":166692,"name":"Persilux Zebra Blinds Dual Layer Roller Sheer Shades (46\" W X 72\" H, Beige) Light Filtering Privacy Light Control for Day and Night Roller Window Shad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KWH5bHKMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Excellent Material】100% excellent polyester imported, waterproof, good ventilation, anti-static, dust-proof, durable. Its breathable dual layer design has alternating sheer and solid fabric for your desired level of privacy and light filtration. Good UV Protection and nice durability for all season long. 【Safety Design】Persilux versatile blinds can be smoothly and Silently rolled up to have clear view outside with its metal chain. Besides, every blind is equipped with a chain connector,you can fix the chain to the wall, which always keep cords and bead chain out of children or pets. 【Excellent Accessories】Our zebra shades have been upgraded to have a sturdier bottom rail to prevent the fabric from fraying, which makes the two layers of fabrics more closely fit, maximizing the effect of shading. Besides, there is an anti-collision strip installed under the rail, which can protect your window frame. 【Multiple Situation】This versatile window shade compliments any interior style as it gently filters harsh UV rays. Its modern functions and essential color selection make these shades perfect for your living room, bedroom, dining room, office and more. 【Please Note】&【Support Customization】❶Fabric width will be 1.2\" shorter than the size of the valance. Our zebra blinds can be used for either inside mount or outside mount. You will also receive an installation guide, installation hardware and for more size options of this same blinds. Pls feel free to MSG us if there are any questions.❷You can also click the \"Customized\" option to make customization by yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KWH5bHKMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Persilux","source_asin":"B08ZXZLNDP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZXZLNDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZXZLNDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":166693,"name":"KopBeau Portable Camping Fan, 20000mAh Detachable Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan, Battery Powered Outdoor Tent Fan with 4 Speeds & Hook, Personal U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UOk+QlHiL._AC_.jpg","description":"【2023 New Detachable Design】This portable fan is designed to provide convenience during your outdoor adventures. Kopbeau battery operated fan comes with 2 x 10000mAh rechargeable batteries that can be detached and used as power banks to charge other devices, such as smartphones or tablets. With this small but high capacity battery, this ventilador portatil features a high-quality rechargeable battery that provides long-lasting power. 【Fast Charging & Saving Time】That's right! You can charge two batteries simultaneously which saves time and ensures that you always have a fully charged backup battery. The batteries can be fully charged in as little as 4~5 hours, which is relatively fast than other outdoor camping tent fan. You will enjoy up to 86hrs or more if your batteries are fully charged. This is especially useful when you're away from a power source for an extended period and need to rely on the fan to keep you cool and comfortable. 【Stay Cool Wherever You Go】The battery powered fan is designed to produce a powerful airflow, With a maximum speed and an airflow rate of 2950 RFM, this makes it a highly effective tool for keeping you cool and comfortable during hot summer days or in stuffy indoor environments.The fan's powerful airflow, combined with its portable and cordless design, makes it an excellent camping accessories for outdoor activities such as camping, hiking, or picnic. 【Sturdy & Anti-Drop】 With the sturdy and durable ABS material, it featuring a sturdy and anti-drop design, this ventilador portatil recargable is built to last and can handle rough terrain and accidental drops. Whether you're camping in the wilderness or spending a day at the beach, you can trust that this fan will be able to keep up with you every step of the way. Just stay cool and comfortable on your next camping trip with our KopBeau battery operated camping fan! 【Multifunctional for Outdoor/Indoor】The cordless camping fan is designed to be highly portable and versatile. With a convenient handle and a 360° hanging hook that makes it easy to carry or hang the fan wherever you need it. The fan also comes with three levels of LED light, which can be used to provide additional illumination in dark environments such as tents or cabins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UOk+QlHiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KopBeau","source_asin":"B082WZYFJV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WZYFJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WZYFJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
