window.products.push({"id":166964,"name":"Mecity Toaster 2 Slice Stainless Steel Toaster Countdown Timer, Bagel / Defrost / Reheat / Cancel Functions,Warming Rack, Removable Crumb Tray, 6 Brow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RcNIL-d2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fancy Small Toaster】: Mecity 2 slice toaster is small in size but powerful in toasting, built- in warming racks on the top and 1.5 inch wide and 4.7 inch deep slots, you could easily toast breads, waffles, English muffins, bagels, croissants, and other breads in regular and irregular shapes. Make breads toasted quickly and evenly. 【6 Browning Settings】: The small toaster could toast at 1 to 6 browning levels by spinning the dial, so that you could get breads from dry out to golden browning even dark brown, easy toasting for your taste. Whatever you enjoys toasts with fantastic outer crunch or soft and fluffy taste, or you want them both, this toaster will always be your satisfying choice. 【Digital Countdown Time】r: After the lever pressed down, the digital countdown timer will dispaly the browning level you chose for 4 seconds, then a countdown timer will tell you how much time needed to complete the toasting, helps you to keep other kitchen works orgnized. The breads will pop up at a position where you can easily get breads out without burning fingers. 【More Heating Modes】: There are more modes to meet your daily needs, REHEAT mode will heat your toasts for 30 seconds to warm them up, BAGEL mode will heat up one side and keep the other side warm, in DEFROST mode you could easily defrost and toast the breads at one go. 【Easy To Clean】: Made of non-stick food grade stainless steel in toasting slots, and a removal crumb tray on the bottom, you can always clean the bread toaster with less effort. Stainless steel and heat resistant material lead to a cool touch exterior and easy cleaning appliance in your kitchen (The slots is hot during toasting, do not touch directly)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RcNIL-d2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mecity","source_asin":"B0B17WXZ76","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-166964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B17WXZ76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B17WXZ76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
